BOARD & PROCEDURAL GRAPHICS
The porcelain-enamel whiteboard, studio vignette and ghosted wiped diagrams, brushed aluminium frame and marker tray, magnetic label strips, dome magnets, steel mm rulers, pinned briefing cards, rubber stamps, and all three-colour dry-erase marker strokes are drawn procedurally in code (kit/board.js, scenes/_gen_film.py).

