FACTS & MEDICAL SOURCES
Every statistic, pathogen dimension, incubation/transport figure, and clinical PEP protocol step in the narration and on the board is documented and cross-checked in FACTS.md against:
- World Health Organization (WHO), WHO Expert Consultation on Rabies: Third Report, WHO Technical Report Series No. 1012 (2018), ISBN 978-92-4-121021-8, & WHO Rabies Fact Sheet (2024).
- Chinese Center for Disease Control and Prevention (China CDC / National Disease Control and Prevention Administration), Work Specification for Rabies Exposure Prophylaxis and Disposal (2023 Edition) / 《狂犬病暴露预防处置工作规范（2023年版）》.
